---
const {
  eyebrow = 'SIMPLE PRICING',
  title = 'Start small.',
  titleAccent = 'Scale when you need more.',
  description = 'Everything you need to create mockups, manage approvals, and generate production-ready files.',
} = Astro.props;
---
<section class="pricing-section section-shell" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="pricing-title">
        <header class="pricing-intro"><h1 id="pricing-title">{eyebrow}</h1><h2>{title}<br><span>{titleAccent}</span></h2><p>{description}</p></header>
        <div class="pricing-plans">
          <article class="pricing-plan"><h3>Starter</h3><p class="pricing-fit">For individuals and smaller promo teams getting their approval workflow organized.</p><p class="pricing-price"><strong>$30</strong> /month</p><p class="pricing-trial">30 days free</p><dl><div><dt>Production files / month</dt><dd>30</dd></div><div><dt>Cloud storage</dt><dd>30 GB</dd></div></dl><p class="pricing-overage">After 30 included files:<br><strong>$3 per additional production file.</strong></p><a class="pricing-button" href="https://app.promoplus.io/signup" target="_blank" data-signup-plan="starter" data-cro-event="pricing_starter_cta_click">Start 30-Day Free Trial</a></article>
          <article class="pricing-plan pricing-pro"><h3>Pro</h3><p class="pricing-fit">For growing teams producing more mockups and production files every month.</p><p class="pricing-price"><strong>$100</strong> /month</p><p class="pricing-trial" aria-label="No free trial">—</p><dl><div><dt>Production files / month</dt><dd>100</dd></div><div><dt>Cloud storage</dt><dd>100 GB</dd></div></dl><p class="pricing-overage">After 100 included files:<br><strong>$1 per additional production file.</strong></p><a class="pricing-button" href="https://app.promoplus.io/signup" target="_blank" data-signup-plan="pro" data-cro-event="pricing_pro_cta_click">Choose Pro</a></article>
          <article class="pricing-plan pricing-custom"><h3>Custom</h3><p class="pricing-fit">For teams that need higher production volume, additional storage, team controls, or integrations.</p><p class="pricing-price pricing-custom-price"><strong>Talk to Sales</strong></p><p class="pricing-trial" aria-label="No free trial">—</p><dl><div><dt>Production files / month</dt><dd>Custom</dd></div><div><dt>Cloud storage</dt><dd>Custom</dd></div></dl><p class="pricing-overage">Additional production files:<br><strong>Volume pricing.</strong></p><a class="pricing-button" href="/contact" data-cro-event="pricing_custom_click">Talk to Sales</a></article>
        </div>
        <div class="pricing-comparison"><h3>Compare plans</h3><div class="pricing-table-wrap"><table><caption class="sr-only">PromoPlus plan comparison</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Included</th><th scope="col">Starter</th><th scope="col">Pro</th><th scope="col">Custom</th></tr></thead><tbody>
          <tr><th scope="row">Monthly price</th><td>$30/month</td><td>$100/month</td><td>Talk to Sales</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Free trial</th><td>30 days</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Production files included</th><td>30/month</td><td>100/month</td><td>Custom</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Additional production file</th><td>$3 each</td><td>$1 each</td><td>Volume pricing</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Cloud storage</th><td>30 GB</td><td>100 GB</td><td>Custom</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Mockups</th><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Online approvals</th><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">SVG logo editor</th><td>Included</td><td>Included</td><td>Included</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Logo color editing</th><td>Included</td><td>Included</td><td>Included</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Decoration positions</th><td>Front / Back / Side included</td><td>Front / Back / Side included</td><td>Included</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Re-download existing files</th><td>Free</td><td>Free</td><td>Free</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Brand library</th><td>Basic</td><td>Advanced</td><td>Custom</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Team features</th><td>Basic</td><td>Advanced</td><td>Custom</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">API / integrations</th><td>Not included</td><td>Not included</td><td>Available</td></tr>
        </tbody></table></div></div>
        <p class="pricing-note">A production file is generated from an approved product mockup and includes the information your team needs for production handoff.</p>
        <div class="custom-plan-contact" id="custom-plan-form" aria-labelledby="custom-plan-heading">
          <div class="custom-plan-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow">CUSTOM PLAN</p>
            <h3 id="custom-plan-heading">Let's build a plan<br>around your workflow.</h3>
            <p>Tell us about your business and what you need from PromoPlus. We'll help shape a plan that fits your team.</p>
            <ul class="custom-plan-reasons" aria-label="Custom plan options">
              <li>Higher production volume</li>
              <li>Flexible storage and team needs</li>
              <li>API &amp; integrations</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          
        </div>
      </section>
